        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Russell Tovey, Arinze Kene\n- Works: The Pass, The History Boys, Him & Her, Looking, Sherlock\n- Roles: Rudge, Steve, Kevin Matheson, Henry Knight\n\nFacts:\n- The Pass is a 2016 film starring Russell Tovey and Arinze Kene.\n- Russell Tovey played Rudge in both the stage and film versions of The History Boys.\n- Russell Tovey played Steve in the BBC Three sitcom Him & Her.\n- Russell Tovey played Kevin Matheson in the HBO original series Looking.\n- Russell Tovey played Henry Knight in the BBC TV series Sherlock.",
